{"id": "unknown-2026-05-28-010", "date": "2026-05-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 22, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["weak", "uncertainty", "pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "MEG extends dip amid weak textile demand", "content": "Asian MEG prices continued correcting through May 2026 as weak polyester, textile and PET resin demand reduced buying activity across China, India and Southeast Asia.\nCompetitive imported cargoes widened pressure on Chinese domestic producers, while textile mills adopted cautious hand-to-mouth purchasing amid weak export orders and uncertainty linked to US-Iran geopolitical tensions.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/meg-extends-dip-amid-weak-textile-demand-310607-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-28-011", "date": "2026-05-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 22, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["growth", "slow"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Sri Lanka gets $695 mn IMF tranche as economic risks rise", "content": "The Middle East war has significantly worsened Sri Lanka’s economic outlook and tilted risks to the downside, with 2026 growth projected to slow down to 3 per cent, the IMF has said. \nIts executive board has completed the combined fifth and sixth reviews of the Extended Fund Facility for the country. \nThis provided the country with immediate access to $695 million to support economic policies and reforms. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/sri-lanka-gets-695-mn-imf-tranche-as-economic-risks-rise-310601-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-28-012", "date": "2026-05-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 22, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "US team to visit India from June 1-4 to finalise interim trade pact", "content": "A US team will visit India from June 1 to 4 to finalise the details of the bilateral interim agreement and take forward talks on a broader bilateral trade agreement (BTA), the Indian Ministry of Commerce announced yesterday. \nThis will be the second in-person meeting between the two sides since February 2026. \nIndia’s chief negotiator Darpan Jain had the last in-person meeting in Washington DC in April. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/us-team-to-visit-india-from-june-1-4-to-finalise-interim-trade-pact-310599-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-28-013", "date": "2026-05-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 22, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["improve", "loss", "decline", "weak", "pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "ICE cotton extends decline on weak crude, better US weather", "content": "ICE cotton futures extended losses to fresh one-and-a-half-month lows as falling crude oil prices, improved US weather forecasts and rising certified stocks pressured sentiment.\nBetter rainfall prospects in West Texas and faster US planting progress reinforced expectations of stable supplies, while weaker crude reduced cotton’s competitiveness against cheaper polyester fibre.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/ice-cotton-extends-decline-on-weak-crude-better-us-weather-310596-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-28-014", "date": "2026-05-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 22, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["growth", "weak", "[否定]challenging", "uncertainty"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Italian economy projected to continue to grow at modest pace: IMF", "content": "Economic activity in Italy faces an increasingly challenging near‑term outlook, with the economy projected to grow at a modest pace, weighed down by external headwinds and structural challenges, the IMF said. \nMedium‑term growth prospects are subdued, constrained by weak productivity growth and population aging. \nUncertainty around the outlook is high, as downside risks to growth accumulate, it noted. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/italian-economy-projected-to-continue-to-grow-at-modest-pace-imf-310593-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-28-015", "date": "2026-05-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 22, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["[否定]challenging"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Eurozone financial stability vulnerabilities elevated: ECB", "content": "The outlook for euro area financial stability is being shaped by geo-economic stress and energy supply disruptions, with the severity and duration of the fallout still uncertain, the European Central Bank said. \nFiscal expansion in a challenging geo-economic environment could strain public finances further in some highly indebted euro area countries and lead to a repricing of sovereign risk. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/eurozone-financial-stability-vulnerabilities-elevated-ecb-310586-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
